[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_APPROACH_TIREK]
Approach to Tirek

[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_APPROACH_TIREK_desc]
Among the “Big Three”, we have already gained the protection of the Changeling Empire and the Equestria Empire. The only one that has not yet cooperated with us is the Centaur Empire at the other end of the Equestrian World.\nTirek seems... sorry, I should correct my habit in advance, to leave a good impression on the client... Lord Tirek! He is not interested in the outside world, but if we can let the Centaurs in his hometown see the prosperous world outside, it will be a huge potential market—no, the Centaurs themselves are not many, but if Lord Tirek is willing to help us promote... you know... forced promotion...

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_APPROACH_TIREK]
接触提雷克

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_APPROACH_TIREK_desc]
在三巨头中，我们已经拥有幻形灵帝国和小马利亚帝国两家的保护，唯一还没有与我们开展合作的就是远在小马利亚世界另一端的半人马帝国。\n提雷克似乎... 抱歉，应该提前纠正习惯了，给客户留下一个好印象... 提雷克大王！对于外界的事情并不感兴趣，但如果可以让他家乡中的半人马看到外面繁荣的世界，这将是一个潜力巨大的市场——不，半人马本身并不多，但如果提雷克大王愿意帮助我们推广... 你懂得... 强制推广...

